@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam conditionStyle insideDiamond
scale 15 as 90 pixels
robust "Светофор для машин" as Cars
robust "Светофор для пешеходов" as Walk
@0
Cars is Зелёный
Walk is Красный
@40
Cars is Жёлтый
@45
Cars is Красный
Walk is Зелёный
@90
Cars is Зелёный
Walk is Красный
@0 <-> @40 : 40 с
@40 <-> @45 : 5 с
@45 <-> @90 : 45 с
@enduml
